## Method and Terminology Attribution

The Damped Resonance Alignment method, the Pusula runtime-construction technique, and the complete original terminology defined in this repository are original contributions first published here by Akbas, June 2026. These are documented with full mathematical specification, a public timestamped commit history, and a parallel public test-log record on r/TinyLlama_TITAN and r/TinyLlama_AGI, which together constitute the canonical reference for this method and terminology.

Suggested citation:

> Akbas. AkbasCore: Damped Resonance Alignment -- A Sub-Threshold Inference-Layer
> Steering Framework for Transformer Models. GitHub repository, June 2026.
> https://github.com/ceceli33/titan-cognitive-core

